<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net buyers of S.African bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of S.African bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of South African bonds last week despite heavy selling on Friday, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				   Week to Feb 7   Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		8,351.61	  32,301.34</p>
<p>    - sales		    7,741.27	  29,492.95</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)  610.35	   2,808.39</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
